  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - Before the development hereby permitted is commenced a scheme indicating the provision to be made for disabled people to gain access tothe shop shall have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The agreed scheme shall be implemented before the development hereby permitted is brought into use.",
    "Condition : 6 - The windows formed in the northern elevation shall be obscure glazed, hinged to open inwards and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing.",
    "Condition : 7 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the flank walls of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - The use shall not commence until a scheme for control of fumes and odours including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority in writing.",
    "Condition : 9 - The external height of ground floor extension to restaurant on the boundary with adjacent property numbered 7A shall not exceed 3.15m from existing ground level as shown on drawing number 2073 PL 07.02A received by Council on the 1st September, 2004."
